OL,3,AUK government expected to announce
OL,4,Adecision on Jackdaw gas field in the
OL,5,ANorth Sea
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government is expected to
OL,8,Fannounce a long-awaited decision on
OL,9,Fwhether gas can be extracted from the
OL,10,FJackdaw field in the North Sea
OL,12,FIt's widely expected in Westminster
OL,13,Fthat Jackdaw will be approved - but
OL,14,Fthat a decision on the Rosebank oil
OL,15,Ffield, off Shetland, will not be made
OL,16,Fyet
OL,18,FJackdaw was approved by the
OL,19,FConservative government in 2022, but
OL,20,Fwas delayed by legal challenges from
OL,21,Fenvironmental campaigners - here's a
OL,22,Fbrief history
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
